01:15:17,647 --> 01:15:23,647
Blood Ties is a 2013 crime thriller film directed by Guillaume Canet and starring Clive
Owen, Billy Crudup, Marion Cotillard, Mila Kunis and Matthias Schoenaerts.

11
01:22:49,411 --> 01:22:55,411
It is a remake of the 2008 French thriller film Les liens du sang by Jacques Maillot, an
adaptation of the French novel Deux frères: flic & truand by Bruno and Michel Papet.

12
01:30:21,176 --> 01:30:27,176
The screenplay was written by Canet and James Gray.

13
01:37:52,941 --> 01:37:58,941
The film was selected to be screened out of
competition at the 2013 Cannes Film Festival.

14
01:45:24,705 --> 01:45:30,705
The film is a co-production between France and the United States.

15
01:52:56,470 --> 01:53:02,470
It was released in France by Mars Distribution on October 30, 2013, and by
Roadside Attractions in the United States on March 21, 2014.

16
02:00:28,235 --> 02:00:34,235
The tone is emotional and intense.
